{
  "id": "6aa8d673bd37cf51f7802186",
  "title": "乳化",
  "created": 1789449844,
  "updated": 1789452843,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa8d673bd37cf51f7802186",
      "text": "乳化",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d7200000000000c4a877",
      "text": ">「乳化」とは、水と油のように本来は混ざり合わないものが均一に混ざり合う現象のこと。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789450016,
      "updated": 1789450018
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6dc0000000000c4a873",
      "text": "\t[「乳化」ってどんな現象？原理や具体例を解説！_クラシル https://www.kurashiru.com/articles/5e93a5aa-e33c-4c82-9a38-517c0ac50af1]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449949,
      "updated": 1789449983
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6dd0000000000c4a874",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449949,
      "updated": 1789449949
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86a",
      "text": "\t水中油滴型",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86b",
      "text": "\t\t水分の中に、細かくなった油の粒子が分散している状態。サラッとした質感になりやすい。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86c",
      "text": "\t\t主な食品・料理",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86d",
      "text": "\t\t\t[パスタ]（[ペペロンチーノ]）、[マヨネーズ]、[牛乳]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86e",
      "text": "\t油中水滴型",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a86f",
      "text": "\t\t油分の中に、細かくなった水の粒子が分散している状態。こってりとした質感になる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a870",
      "text": "\t\t主な食品・料理",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a871",
      "text": "\t\t\t[バター]、[マーガリン]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789449844
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8d6740000000000c4a872",
      "text": "  食品以外",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789449844,
      "updated": 1789452778
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8e1e9000000000080b20d",
      "text": "   [ニベアクリーム青缶] ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789452778,
      "updated": 1789452797
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8e201000000000080b211",
      "text": "    [\" NIVEA Creme is a water-in -oil (W/O) emulsion, i.e. tiny water droplets \"swimming\" in an oil phase.] [. https://www.nivea.co.uk/articles/education/faq/creme-and-soft-faq]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789452801,
      "updated": 1789452843
    },
